    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"p2\">The astral body of the wizard separates from<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>the physical one, barely visible like a ghost. They can project their astral body up to 100 meters with a Movement characteristic of 12, and see everything that is visible, but they can not interact with material objects or speak. Their physical body lies in a stasis state, and it is incapable of performing any action or perceiving their surroundings. The wizard can cancel the spell instantaneously.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></p>"
